    <fullName>Schedule_Proposal_Status__c</fullName>
    <description>Stage 7 (Scheduling). Workflow state of the AutoScheduleService proposal. Pending Review = waiting on Scheduling Manager. Manager Approved = auto-promotes to Scheduled_Date + Crew + Schedule_Locked + fires SchedulingService.onScheduleLocked. Manager Rejected = needs manual reschedule. Manual Override = scheduler bypassed the proposal.</description>
